  "description": "MUVZIO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H82 F30 Fe6 O20 Yb4,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Fe3 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe4 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe5 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Fe6 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe7 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe8 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 7 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.657-3.742 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.10-112.89°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb4(μ-OH)2(μ-OCH3)4(CH3OH)2(Fcpfa)6].",
